<title>POLAND: Mostostal-G Q2 net rises to PLN 1.6 mln. [CORRECTED 15:36 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mostostal-G Q2 net rises to PLN 1.6 mln. [CORRECTED 15:36 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Gdansk preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.05 vs	1.31</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.15 vs	0.68</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.60 vs	0.41</p>
<p>(corrects Q2 net profit from 0.91 to 1.60 for 1997 and the 1996 figure from 0.66 to 0.41)</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 25.33 vs     24.81</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  20.12 vs     22.26</p>
<p>(corrects 1996 Q2 cost of sales figure from 22.20 to 22.26)</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.54 vs	0.27</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     4.32 vs	0.01 loss</p>
<p>    financial costs			  5.21 vs	0.62</p>
<p>    investment				 7.63 vs	1.40</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.05 vs	1.69</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.72 vs	0.70</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.02 vs	0.42</p>
<p>    net sales				 48.86 vs     33.05</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  41.00 vs     28.99</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.70 vs	0.28</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     4.45 vs	1.09</p>
<p>    financial costs			  5.78 vs	2.08</p>
<p>    investment				 8.60 vs	2.69</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
